---
title: Container operation - intent, approval, effect, run and shutdown (implemented)
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Agent as Agent or person
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant AP as Approvals (OwnerPreview)
  participant CS as ContainerService
  participant Q as Store and queue
  participant D as Dispatcher (container_effects, container_stops)
  participant CR as ContainerRunner
  participant PS as ProcessSupervisor
  participant CLI as docker, podman or container CLI
  Agent->>GW: containers.build, pull, create, start, exec or stop
  opt build, pull, create, start, exec
    GW->>AP: approval_preview(request)
    AP->>CS: approval_preview (host paths, ports, Dockerfile digest, context digest)
    Note over AP: a person approves the exact request digest
  end
  GW->>CS: decide in the receipt transaction
  CS->>Q: recheck_reviewed binding, requested_backend must equal the selected backend
  alt create
    CS->>Q: reserve resource leases (CapacityWait rolls back), insert StoredContainer as Creating
  else start or stop
    CS->>Q: check expected_revision and phase, move to Starting or Stopping
  end
  CS->>Q: ContainerIntent frozen as the operation payload, enqueue (Stop goes to container_stops)
  Q-->>Agent: receipt, Accepted with operation id
  Note over CS,CLI: no engine command ran before the receipt committed
  D->>CS: execute_effect(operation, authority)
  CS->>CS: command_context rebuilds the context and authorizes with current authority
  CS->>CS: take image_gate (build, pull, create) and the per-container lifecycle gate
  CS->>CS: authorize again after the wait
  CS->>CR: run(bound_spec argv, timeout, output cap, redactions)
  CR->>PS: owned process launch
  PS->>CLI: engine command
  CLI-->>CS: exit code and bounded output
  alt exit verified
    CS->>Q: settle_phase Created, Running or Stopped (leases released on Stopped or Failed)
    CS-->>D: Completed
  else create refused
    CS->>Q: settle_phase Creating to Failed, release reservations
    CS-->>D: Failed
  else outcome not known
    CS-->>D: Unknown
    D->>CS: observe_effect inspects labels and immutable id, never repeats the command
  end
  Note over CS,CLI: shutdown path
  CS->>Q: AgentWorkMayRun rows, one at a time under the lifecycle gate
  CS->>CLI: inspect, check ownership labels, stop only the verified native id
  CLI-->>CS: Stopped confirmed, else the row stays Uncertain
